ws that spell.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_206","a","005","question",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_999","Huh? You Novians can't use it? That magic is ... pretty standard.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_118","a","005","symbol",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_118","Standard? The Eye of Grace records are clear—every single experiment on healing magic has failed.",0,""],["w",0.5],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"OutSine",0.5,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_118","a","015","attention",0.67,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["say","avg1_118","Wait... Did you just say ... \"You Novians\"?",0,""],["ctl","avg1_118","a","014",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_118","White hair... Pointed ears... Long, twisted horns.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_118","a","005","shock",null,null,null,null,"jushou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_118","You're a Bayan... Are you from Nocturn Eterna?!",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_118","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["ctl","avg3_206","a","003","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_999","Took you long enough. You're slow, Novian.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_206","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutSine",0.35],["ctl","avg1_118","a",null,null,0.5,-0.2,1.3,null,null,"OutSine",0.5],["ctl","avg1_118","a","015",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_118","If Nocturn Eterna has healing magic... Then it is possible? Theoretically, we Novians should be able to replicate it!",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_118","a",null,null,0.7,0.0,1.0,null,null,"OutSine",0.5],["ctl","avg3_206","a","002",null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_118","a","009",null,null,null,null,null,"jushou","OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_118","Hey, could you do that ag—==W==sorry, haven't even introduced myself.",0,""],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg1_118","a","005","attention",null,null,null,null,"ChanDou","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["se","se_062"],["ctl","avg1_118","a","008",null,0.65,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_118","I'm Coronis. May I ask your name? You don't have to answer, but ... I'd like to know who saved me.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_206","a","008","speechless",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_999","Name's...==W== Noctiluna.",0,""],["w",1.5],["ctl","avg3_206","a","005",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["stg",0,120.0,-100.0,1.3,"OutSine",0.35,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_118","a","018",null,0.55,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["se","se_019"],["ctl","avg3_206","a","005","attention",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.5],["w",1.0],["say","avg1_118","Noctiluna, could you cast that spell again? Look, I got too excited and tore the wound open!",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_206","a","008",null,null,null,null,null,"niunie","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_206","Ugh... Fine. Lie down.",0,""],["w",0.5],["clear",1,0.5,1],["bg","BG_Black",0,1.0],["w",1.0],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["se","se_100"],["w",1.5],["se","se_219"],["w",1.0],["say","0","Noctiluna places a palm over the wound. A cold white light flashes, and the pain fades.",0,""],["w",0.5],["bg","cavern",0,1.0],["w",1.5],["show","avg1_118","a","005",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_118","a",null,"exclamation",null,null,null,1.0,"jushou","OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_118","Wait, got a mirror? I need to see this!",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_118","a","014",null,null,-0.25,1.35,null,null,"OutSine",0.5],["ctl","avg1_118","a",null,"speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg1_118","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_118","... Fascinating. The shattered lens didn't regenerate, but the tissue healed naturally. Pain's gone too...==W== So if the structure is intact, full recovery is possible?!",0,""],["w",1.5],["ctl","avg1_118","a","005","idea",null,null,null,null,"jushou","OutSine",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_118","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["w",0.5],["cbg",0,180.0,null,1.1,"OutSine",0.5,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_118","a","016",null,0.7,0.0,1.0,null,null,"OutSine",0.0],["ctl","avg1_118","a",null,null,0.65,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["show","avg3_206","a","002",0.3,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_206","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["ctl","avg1_118","a",null,"happy",null,null,null,null,"huanxin","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_118","Incredible magic! Noctiluna, how does it even work?!",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_206","a","008","question",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["w",1.0],["say","avg3_206","Has ... anyone ever told you that you're weird?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_206","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_206","A normal Novian would've started with, \"What's your purpose?\" or \"Why are you here?\"",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_206","a","007",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_206","But you're obsessed with my magic... This isn't how I pictured this going.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_118","a","013","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_118","Define \"normal.\" Or \"abnormal.\" It's all subjective.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_118","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_118","a","008","music",null,null,null,null,"JuGong1","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_118","Why waste time on semantics when the mysteries of biology are far more fascinating?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_206","a","008","awkward",0.25,null,null,null,"jingxia","OutSine",0.5],["say","avg3_206","Okay, she's definitely got a screw loose!!==W== ... So, you're seriously not afraid of us?",0,""],["w",1.5],["ctl","avg3_206","a","005",null,0.3,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_118","a","003","question",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_118","Why should I be? Aside from the horns, are Bayans really distinct from us?",0,""],["say","avg1_118","Physiologically speaking, we're practically the same species, aren't we?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_118","a","018","idea",null,null,null,null,"jushou0","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.7],["stg",0,100.0,null,1.1,"OutSine",0.35,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_118","a",null,null,0.55,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["say","avg1_118","Speaking of which, may I touch them? I need to know—are they keratin or solid bone?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_206","a","008","vexation",0.25,null,null,null,"jingxia","OutSine",0.5],["stg",0,180.0,null,null,"OutSine",0.5,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["say","avg3_206","Are... Are you seriously a Novian?",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_146"],["ctl","avg3_206","a","006",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou2","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_206","Horns are vital! You can't just let people touch them—not even our own kin!",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_118","a","009","attention",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_118","Is that so? How intriguing.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_206","a","008",null,null,null,null,null,"niunie","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_206","Look... Your wound's healed, so start moving. This isn't a place for Novians.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_118","a","013",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_118","I refuse.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_206","a","009","flurry",0.3,null,null,null,"diantou2","OutSine",0.5],["say","avg3_206","Weird... I thought we spoke the same language. Am I not clear? This is a Nocturn Eterna stronghold now. You aren't welcome here.",0,""],["w",0.5],["stg",0,300.0,-120.0,1.5,"OutSine",0.5,null,null,null],["se","se_208"],["ctl","avg1_118","a","014",null,0.5,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.5],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_206","a","008","exclamation",null,null,null,null,"ChanDou","Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_118","My injured eye still throbs, you know. If I leave your side and the wound tears open on the way back... Well, I'm done for.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_118","a","004",null,0.45,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.5],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_206","a",null,"flurry",null,null,null,null,"chijing","OutSine",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_118","Besides, the Monolith Meltdown was recent. This area could be crawling with Stellaroids. Please, let me stay until I make a full recovery.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_206","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_206","Well... I...",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_118","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,"daintou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_118","I promise I won't touch your horns or cause any trouble. Deal?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_206","a",null,"shy",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",1.0],["w",1.0],["stg",0,450.0,null,1.4,"OutSine",0.5,null,null,null],["se","se_112"],["ctl","avg3_206","a","006",null,0.2,null,null,null,"huanxin","OutSine",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg3_206","Ugh, fine. Three days. That should be plenty of time to heal up.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_118","a","008","music",null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",1.0],["w",1.5],["trn",0,0,true,true,1.0],["w",1.0],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["say","0","Three days later.",8,""],["bg","forest",0,1.0],["w",1.0],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.5],["show","avg1_118","a","013",0.65,null,null,0,null,0.0],["show","avg3_206","a","009",0.3,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_118","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_206","a",null,"flurry",0.35,null,null,1.0,"huanxin","OutSine",0.5],["say","avg3_206","Coronis! How did you manage to hurt yourself again?!",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_118","a","008",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_118","I can't help it. My right eye is blind, my field of view is narrow, and my depth perception is shot... I simply lost my footing.==W== Noctiluna, quick, heal—",0,""],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg1_118","a",null,"attention",null,null,null,null,"zuochupeng","OutSine",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_206","a","006","angry",null,null,null,null,"chijing","OutSine",0.5],["say","avg3_206","Liar! I saw you skipping stones by the lake this morning—perfect aim every time! How could you possibly tumble down a gentle slope like this?",0,""],["say","avg3_206","You hurt yourself on purpose, didn't you? You're doing this just to make me cast that spell again!",0,""],["ctl","avg3_206","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_118","a","012",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_118","Well... I knew you wouldn't explain the principles to me directly. So, using myself as a test subject seemed like a fair compromise.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_206","a","009",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan2","Linear",1.0],["say","avg3_206","...",0,""],["ctl","avg3_206","a","003","sigh",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["w",1.5],["ctl","avg3_206","a","006",null,0.5,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.5],["w",0.5],["se","se_019"],["ctl","avg3_206","a",null,null,0.4,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.5],["ctl","avg1_118","a","002",null,0.6,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.5],["say","avg3_206","Unbelievable. Come here.",0,""],["w",0.5],["clear",1,0.5,1],["bg","BG_Black",0,1.0],["w",1.0],["stg",0,null,null,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_219"],["w",1],["se","se_295"],["say","avg1_118","Hmm... Fascinating. An itch, like flesh regenerating at an accelerated rate. Is the mechanism based on hyper-stimulating the body's natural recovery?",0,""],["w",0.5],["say","avg3_206","Stop speculating. I will not share our secrets with a Novian.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_100"],["w",1],["bg","forest",0,1.0],["w",1.0],["show","avg3_206","a","006",0.35,null,null,0,null,0.0],["show","avg1_118","a","012",0.65,null,null,0,null,0.0],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_206","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["ctl","avg1_118","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_206","a",null,"angry",null,null,null,null,"youchupeng","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_206","And stop injuring yourself. I mean it—this is the last time.==W== Do not treat this lightly; it drains a significant amount of magic.",0,""],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg3_206","a",null,"resentful",null,null,null,null,"buman","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["bgm",""],["ctl","avg3_206","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["ctl","avg1_118","a","014",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_118","Significant magic drain, you say...",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_206","a","005","attention",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.5],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg1_118","a",null,null,0.63,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_118","In the last two days, you've cast that spell on me five times. Yet, your Soul Stone's glow hasn't dimmed in the slightest. Conversely, you appear visibly more exhausted after every incantation.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_206","a","008","flurry",0.32,null,null,null,"jingxia","OutSine",0.5],["w",1.25],["se","se_062"],["stg",0,50.0,-30.0,1.25,"OutSine",0.5,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_118","a","011",null,0.55,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.25],["w",0.25],["se","se_019"],["ctl","avg3_206","a","005",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_118","My hypothesis is that the magic you're burning isn't the Grace from the Soul Stone at all.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_206","a","009","exclamation",null,null,null,null,"chijing2","OutSine",0.5],["say","avg3_206","...",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_176"],["ctl","avg3_206","a","009",null,0.5,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["stg",0,-100.0,-50.0,1.3,"OutSine",0.5,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_118","a","005",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.0],["say","avg3_206","Coronis. You know too much.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_118","a","013","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.5],["w",1.5],["se","se_019"],["ctl","avg1_118","a","003",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["bgm","m61"],["say","avg1_118","The Loong have a saying: \"If one learns the truth in the morning, one may die without regret at sunset.\"",0,""],["ctl","avg1_118","a","009",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_118","If you intend to silence me, could I make one final request? Before I die, tell me the truth behind your magic and its power source.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_146"],["ctl","avg3_206","a","008",null,null,null,null,1.0,"lengzhan","OutSine",0.5],["say","avg3_206","You ... really are a freak.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_118","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["ctl","avg3_206","a","006",null,0.55,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg3_206","I will tell you only this: We of the Nocturn Eterna have no need for what you Novians call \"Grace.\"==W== We do not demean ourselves with stolen magic.",0,""],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg3_206","a","009","exclamation",null,null,null,null,"jushou1","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_206","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["ctl","avg1_118","a","005","symbol",null,null,null,1.0,"chijing","OutSine",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_118","\"Stolen\"? What exactly do you mean?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_118","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["cbg",0,50.0,null,null,"OutSine",0.5,null,null,null],["ctl","avg3_206","a","006",null,0.45,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.0],["se","se_403"],["ctl","avg3_206","a",null,null,0.4,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["say","avg3_206","... Time for you to go. Head east for a day. You'll hit the road to the city-states.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_118","a","013",null,0.69,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.0],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_118","a",null,"sigh",0.7,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_118","Hmm... Fair enough. Thank you for the insight.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_010"],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.